pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primaryTint"
notes: 共创页（深化）：上半部分三种品牌共创玩法（冠名 / 快闪 / 周边），下半部分波浪形传播时间线——预热 4 月、爆发 7 月、长尾 9 月，说明品牌预算换来的不止露出而是一整套传播动作。
elements:
  # ---- 页眉 ----
  - elementId: header-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 41, 10, 10]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: header-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 36, 460, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: 伍 · 品牌共创 CO-CREATION & MEDIA
  - elementId: header-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [556, 36, 340, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [right, top]
      text: TIDAL FEST 2026 · 招商合作方案
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 64, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 82, 460, 36]
    content:
      style: "$disp"
      fontSize: 26
      wrap: false
      text: 不止露出：和品牌一起造浪

  # ---- 三种共创玩法 ----
  - elementId: p1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 132, 44, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: "01"
  - elementId: p1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 134, 220, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: 品牌舞台冠名
  - elementId: p1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 162, 720, 20]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      wrap: false
      text: 把品牌写进节目单：舞台命名、舞美主视觉融入品牌色，主持人口播与直播角标全程跟随。
  - elementId: p-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 196, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: p2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 208, 44, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: p2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 210, 220, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: 联名快闪区
  - elementId: p2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 238, 720, 20]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      wrap: false
      text: 滨海步道 300㎡ 品牌快闪地带：限定饮品站、互动装置与打卡动线，把人流变成体验。
  - elementId: p-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 272, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: p3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 284, 44, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
  - elementId: p3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 286, 220, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: 潮汐限定周边
  - elementId: p3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [116, 314, 720, 20]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      wrap: false
      text: 联名速干毛巾、荧光手环与限定包装现场发售，让观众把音乐节（和品牌）带回家。

  # ---- 传播节奏时间线 ----
  - elementId: tl-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 350, 400, 22]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: 传播节奏 · 三段式浪潮
  - elementId: tl-wave
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 422, 832, 20]
    shapeName: wave
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
    opacity: 0.9
  - elementId: tl-node-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [193, 425, 14, 14]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: tl-node-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [473, 425, 14, 14]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: tl-node-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [753, 425, 14, 14]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: tl-t1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [120, 382, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 预热期 · 04–06 月
  - elementId: tl-d1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 458, 200, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 官宣海报 + 阵容倒计时，品牌悬念联动
  - elementId: tl-t2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [400, 382, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 爆发期 · 07 月
  - elementId: tl-d2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [380, 458, 200, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 现场直播、话题挑战、KOL 打卡集中引爆
  - elementId: tl-t3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 382, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 长尾期 · 08–09 月
  - elementId: tl-d3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 458, 200, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 官方纪录片与回顾短片，持续二次传播

  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 512, 340, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 潮汐音乐节 TIDAL FEST 2026
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [856, 512, 40, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 06 / 07
